---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Apply for Whitelist | Flame Point Roleplay"
  description="Apply for whitelist access to Flame Point Roleplay, a custom FiveM roleplay server."
  active="apply"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">Whitelist Application</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Apply to Join Flame Point</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub reveal">
        We keep Flame Point whitelisted to protect the quality of roleplay in the city. The
        process is quick, but we do read every answer — take your time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section apply-page">
    <div class="container apply-grid">
      <div class="apply-copy reveal">
        <h2>Before You Apply</h2>
        <p>
          Applications are submitted and reviewed through our Discord server, not on this page.
          Here's what to expect before you start:
        </p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Have you read the full <a href="/rules">server rules</a>?</li>
          <li>Have a rough character concept ready — name, background, motivation</li>
          <li>Set aside about 10–15 minutes to answer application questions thoughtfully</li>
          <li>Make sure Discord DMs are open so staff can reach you about your application</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What We Look For</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Understanding of core roleplay concepts (metagaming, powergaming, fear RP)</li>
          <li>Clear, original writing — copied or AI-generated answers are rejected</li>
          <li>A character concept that fits a grounded, realistic city</li>
          <li>A respectful, mature tone throughout your answers</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>After You Submit</h2>
        <p>
          Most applications are reviewed within 24–48 hours. You'll be notified by Discord DM or
          a role update whether you've been accepted, asked for revisions, or denied with
          feedback.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="card apply-card reveal">
        <h3>Ready to Apply?</h3>
        <p>Join the Discord and open the <code>#apply-here</code> channel to start your whitelist application.</p>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/5GKxAhPa4" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Discord to Apply</a>
        <div class="apply-divider"></div>
        <h4>Need Help?</h4>
        <p>
          If you have questions before applying, open a support ticket in the{" "}
          <code>#support</code> channel and our staff team will help you out.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
